{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkout Midnight</strong> is an atmospheric horror game. At night, you work in a supermarket: serving customers, checking IDs for alcohol purchases, counting change, and trying to follow the rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/15ebdd9eb090125f12e7b1e05b66f468.poster.avif?t=1759942360\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/15ebdd9eb090125f12e7b1e05b66f468.webm?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/15ebdd9eb090125f12e7b1e05b66f468.mp4?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then another shift begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/2e92218c4f96fd8445741a9d25c2b07d.poster.avif?t=1759942360\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/2e92218c4f96fd8445741a9d25c2b07d.webm?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/2e92218c4f96fd8445741a9d25c2b07d.mp4?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At some point, the lights start flickering, and you hear strange noises all around. Something is clearly wrong with this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/99db80d4fe3813d518c8d9469e280e22.poster.avif?t=1759942360\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/99db80d4fe3813d518c8d9469e280e22.webm?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/99db80d4fe3813d518c8d9469e280e22.mp4?t=1759942360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket work simulation</strong> \u2013 Routine cashier tasks: customers, goods, money, penalties for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric retro graphics</strong> \u2013 A retro-style visual design that enhances the eerie and immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark story</strong> \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the mysterious supermarket and its staff.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754260?t=1759942360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754260?t=1759942360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/1a4204bfbe7fec05a91a4f6f33891e48dee8a0b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759942360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/1a4204bfbe7fec05a91a4f6f33891e48dee8a0b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759942360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkout Midnight</strong> is an atmospheric horror game. At night, you work in a supermarket: serving customers, checking IDs for alcohol purchases, counting change, and trying to follow the rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb